    "text": "Frequency of oscillation is proportional to\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/2Fka4nbw_giuNK19bw_t9qgWuL0nJxRH2NdnHC2h4NI.original.fullsize.png\">",
