  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/fVXcn21iwp3NiK0FQADxaIUO2mU1h3GRfwNMO5PnGHg.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\r\n\r\nLet mass is displaced towards left by $x$ then force on $\\operatorname{mass}=-\\mathrm{kx}-2 \\mathrm{kx}=-3 \\mathrm{kx}$\r\n\r\n[negative sign is taken because force is opposite to the direction of motion]\r\n\r\n$\\begin{array}{l}\r\n\r\n\\Rightarrow \\mathrm{F}=-3 \\mathrm{kx}=-\\mathrm{m} \\omega^{2} \\mathrm{x} \\Rightarrow \\omega=\\sqrt{\\frac{3 \\mathrm{k}}{\\mathrm{m}}} \\\\\r\n\r\n\\mathrm{f}=\\frac{\\omega}{2 \\pi}=\\frac{1}{2 \\pi} \\sqrt{\\frac{3 \\mathrm{k}}{\\mathrm{m}}}\r\n\r\n\\end{array}$\r\n\r\nThus it is propotional to $\\sqrt{3 \\mathrm{k} / \\mathrm{m}}$",
